@startuml diagrama-minerador

title Bloco 2 — mineração GitHub → JSON em cache

left to right direction

package minerador {
  class MinerConfig {
    + owner : str
    + repo : str
    + token : str
    + output_dir : Path
    + cache_dir : Path
    + per_page : int
    + request_delay : float
    + repo_full_name : str
    + output_file : Path
    + has_token : bool
  }

  class GitHubMinerador {
    + run() : Path
    + ...
  }

  class GitHubClient {
    + get_all_issues() : list[dict]
    + get_issue_comments(issue_number) : list[dict]
    + get_all_pulls() : list[dict]
    + get_pull_comments(pull_number) : list[dict]
    + get_pull_reviews(pull_number) : list[dict]
    + get_issue_events(issue_number) : list[dict]
  }

  class CacheJson {
    + get(key: str) : Any | None
    + set(key: str, data: Any) : void
    + has(key: str) : bool
    + invalidate(key: str) : void
    + clear() : void
  }

  class Interaction <<dataclass>> {
    + source_user : str
    + target_user : str
    + type : str
    + weight : int
    + repo : str
    + created_at : str
    + to_dict() : dict
  }

  class RateLimitError <<exception>> {
  }
}

package "urllib\n<<stdlib>>" as ExtHttp {
}

GitHubMinerador *-- MinerConfig
GitHubMinerador *-- CacheJson
GitHubMinerador *-- GitHubClient
GitHubMinerador ..> Interaction : cria

GitHubClient --> MinerConfig
GitHubClient --> CacheJson
GitHubClient ..> ExtHttp
GitHubClient ..> RateLimitError : <<raises>>

note bottom of GitHubMinerador
  Saída: **interacoes.json** com linhas no contrato acordado
  (``source_user``, ``target_user``, ``type``, ``weight``, …).
  **Não** importa ``AbstractGraph``.
end note

@enduml
